"cues": [
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 3.2,
"end": 12.349,
"text": "This is the inside of the model: a stack of 24 blocks, one on top of another, all built the same way."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 13.099,
"end": 14.98,
"text": "Each block has two parts."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 15.386,
"end": 20.622,
"text": "The first is attention, made of 14 heads working side by side."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 21.029,
"end": 25.173,
"text": "Each head lets a token look back at the tokens before it."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 25.923,
"end": 32.935,
"text": "The second part is the feed-forward network, 4,864 numbers wide."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 33.493,
"end": 39.669,
"text": "It works on each token's vector by itself, without looking at the others."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 40.419,
"end": 42.033,
"text": "Now send in Emma's question."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 42.439,
"end": 49.161,
"text": "All 100 tokens enter at the bottom, each one a vector of 896 numbers."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 49.568,
"end": 59.215,
"text": "In every block, attention lets each token gather from the ones before it, then the feed-forward part reworks each vector on its own."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 59.773,
"end": 65.404,
"text": "All 100 vectors come out changed, and climb to the next block."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 66.154,
"end": 69.335,
"text": "After 24 blocks, the vectors reach the top."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 69.892,
"end": 74.467,
"text": "Next, we open attention, and see what the heads look at."
}
]
}